Package: specqr
Type: Package
Title: Dependency-Free QR Model 2 Encoding from Scratch
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("SpecQR", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "specqr-maintainers@example.invalid")
Description: Encodes QR Model 2 symbols with all forty versions, four error
    correction levels, eight masks, data and control segments, exact segment
    optimization, GS1 helpers, structured append, and SVG and PNG rendering.
    All encoding and rendering algorithms are written in R. No contributed
    packages, external encoders, compiled extensions, or network services are
    required at runtime. Intended as an inspectable reference implementation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.3)
NeedsCompilation: no
URL: https://github.com/SpecQR
